generative AI to play the role of any patient or healthcare colleague for healthcare communications training.\n\n## How It Works\n\nWith the ability to verbally communicate directly via conversational speech with SimConverse, healthcare learners can ask clinical questions and receive accurate simulated patient responses immediately. Using machine learning and Artificial Intelligence, SimConverse provides a multitude of simulated virtual patients complete with medical history, chief complaint, and physical examination findings.\n\nSimConverse was designed to operate within a simulated environment that is safe, repeatable, reflective, and customizable. The AI language model that SimConverse has developed is adaptable to any level of clinical learner and can portray any patient, colleague, or simulated participant role that a scenario requires.\n\n## Scoring and Feedback\n\nSimConverse supports faculty in all aspects of simulation: pre-work, scenario delivery, automated grading with quantitative and qualitative feedback, as well as facilitated self-reflection and debrief. Additionally, following each interaction, students receive detailed personalised feedback, along with access to assessment rubrics and conversation transcripts to support reflection and ongoing learning.\n\n## Effectiveness\n\nAn evaluation of downstream clinical performance with the SEGUE communication skills assessment framework showed nursing learners improved by 1.65 SD (p < 0.001)."],"durationSeconds":8.163023541000003,"searchCount":1}}
