{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01YGvCBsXe6Mj7bFGo6anu2E","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"\"birdbrain\" site:blog.duolingo.com\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"Learning how to help you learn: Introducing Birdbrain!\",\"url\":\"https://blog.duolingo.com/learning-how-to-help-you-learn-introducing-birdbrain/\"},{\"title\":\"Duolingo’s Biggest Technology Innovations\",\"url\":\"https://blog.duolingo.com/duolingo-technology-innovations/\"},{\"title\":\"Cómo usa Duolingo la IA para crear lecciones más rápido\",\"url\":\"https://blog.duolingo.com/es/como-duolingo-usa-la-ia-para-crear-lecciones-mas-rapido/\"},{\"title\":\"Inside Engineering at Duolingo\",\"url\":\"https://blog.duolingo.com/unique-engineering-problems/\"},{\"title\":\"Birdbrain\",\"url\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Birdbrain\"},{\"title\":\"4 Learnings from Duolingo Efficacy Studies\",\"url\":\"https://blog.duolingo.com/results-duolingo-efficacy-studies/\"},{\"title\":\"Duolingo\",\"url\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Duolingo\"},{\"title\":\"How Duolingo uses AI to create lessons faster\",\"url\":\"https://blog.duolingo.com/large-language-model-duolingo-lessons/\"},{\"title\":\"Does Duolingo Work for Learning a Language?\",\"url\":\"https://blog.duolingo.com/how-well-does-duolingo-work/\"},{\"title\":\"En Duolingo, los expertos y la IA trabajan en conjunto para crear una experiencia de aprendizaje de primera\",\"url\":\"https://blog.duolingo.com/es/inteligencia-artificial-duolingo/\"}]\n\nI found several results about Birdbrain on the Duolingo blog. Here's what I found:\n\n**What is Birdbrain?**\n\nDuolingo recently developed a machine learning model affectionately called \"Birdbrain\" which learns both from and about you in order to help you learn. Birdbrain is Duolingo's system for personalizing practice for learners. Every time a learner completes a lesson, Birdbrain ingests the outcome of every individual exercise and uses an in-house ML model to estimate that person's proficiency with different grammar concepts.\n\n**How it Works:**\n\nDuolingo's Birdbrain model is continuously studying both how much learners know as well as the difficulty level of different kinds of language material, and makes an educated guess about whether a learner will get a given exercise right. This system uses data from more than 500 million exercises completed daily on Duolingo to learn both how proficient learners are and how difficult the content is for each of them.\n\n**Results:**\n\nA/B tests using Birdbrain show that using information from Birdbrain to construct lessons at the right difficulty level for each learner has consistently helped learners learn more. Using Birdbrain not only results in improved learning, but also improved engagement – learners are happier with their learning experience and return to their lessons more regularly.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"6e45f550-5a65-4305-802e-931b3b49c5e2","uuid":"ba474ff7-7293-4fa5-9094-45846a53eca3","timestamp":"2026-08-11T02:34:32.004Z","tool_use_result":{"query":"\"birdbrain\" site:blog.duolingo.com","results":[{"tool_use_id":"srvtoolu_01SpLbtzVwknu2LW3TkWE9Zd","content":[{"title":"Learning how to help you learn: Introducing Birdbrain!","url":"https://blog.duolingo.com/learning-how-to-help-you-learn-introducing-birdbrain/"},{"title":"Duolingo’s Biggest Technology Innovations","url":"https://blog.duolingo.com/duolingo-technology-innovations/"},{"title":"Cómo usa Duolingo la IA para crear lecciones más rápido","url":"https://blog.duolingo.com/es/como-duolingo-usa-la-ia-para-crear-lecciones-mas-rapido/"},{"title":"Inside Engineering at Duolingo","url":"https://blog.duolingo.com/unique-engineering-problems/"},{"title":"Birdbrain","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Birdbrain"},{"title":"4 Learnings from Duolingo Efficacy Studies","url":"https://blog.duolingo.com/results-duolingo-efficacy-studies/"},{"title":"Duolingo","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Duolingo"},{"title":"How Duolingo uses AI to create lessons faster","url":"https://blog.duolingo.com/large-language-model-duolingo-lessons/"},{"title":"Does Duolingo Work for Learning a Language?","url":"https://blog.duolingo.com/how-well-does-duolingo-work/"},{"title":"En Duolingo, los expertos y la IA trabajan en conjunto para crear una experiencia de aprendizaje de primera","url":"https://blog.duolingo.com/es/inteligencia-artificial-duolingo/"}]},"I found several results about Birdbrain on the Duolingo blog. Here's what I found:\n\n**What is Birdbrain?**\n\nDuolingo recently developed a machine learning model affectionately called \"Birdbrain\" which learns both from and about you in order to help you learn. Birdbrain is Duolingo's system for personalizing practice for learners. Every time a learner completes a lesson, Birdbrain ingests the outcome of every individual exercise and uses an in-house ML model to estimate that person's proficiency with different grammar concepts.\n\n**How it Works:**\n\nDuolingo's Birdbrain model is continuously studying both how much learners know as well as the difficulty level of different kinds of language material, and makes an educated guess about whether a learner will get a given exercise right. This system uses data from more than 500 million exercises completed daily on Duolingo to learn both how proficient learners are and how difficult the content is for each of them.\n\n**Results:**\n\nA/B tests using Birdbrain show that using information from Birdbrain to construct lessons at the right difficulty level for each learner has consistently helped learners learn more. Using Birdbrain not only results in improved learning, but also improved engagement – learners are happier with their learning experience and return to their lessons more regularly."],"durationSeconds":7.244582792000001,"searchCount":1}}
